          "repository": "luangjokaj/wordpressify",
          "url": "https://github.com/luangjokaj/wordpressify/blob/df91d7e2d2ef991d6818c3ea8ce3d5572b500a56/CHANGELOG.md#L5-L12"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_96c0ed1c86822f47c38a1ef97dd2986ed37fd625be386b3c8916951b390ec80d"
      ],
      "text": "The v0.6.3 installer adds an update subcommand that upgrades existing projects without overwriting theme source files."
    },
    {
