      "text": "Repository development practice: the contributor workflow uses five Docker services (MariaDB, WordPress PHP-FPM, nginx, a permissions helper, and a Node.js Gulp/BrowserSync container), with BrowserSync on port 3010 and nginx on 8080."
    },
